{"v":4,"catch":"湯姆和老鼠之間的一次大冒險在這位迷人的女士身上展開了！","desc":"《Frisky Tom》是由Nichibutsu於1981年發行的動作遊戲。\n控制水管工湯姆，並修理被老鼠弄斷的水管。\n老鼠不僅破壞了管道，還攻擊並引爆了炸彈！\n處理此蟲害問題並完成階段。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-04-15","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/defe76869ce957f678466ebaf99d9ae0071d81a08fc72a3eba424ab0a6aa87a4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e3e77e192e16fa50d817e384d77dbe07054d4e3de3ec6ec79b16515eb22644af.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f2172aa7e4b8cae125277f3139b57d2a74e4936ab1215dcd43915df9250dc476.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1d83f3be8dfabeb9eccd1f55007db4ea87bb2e9437f11f4159844ceece97aa42.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/06b9171ceea44d55e0b94ea95168ed45743d18ef09db98a3c294da7ba321f3d7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ecf13ab82171575ba30dad9630206151c11a3193ede17c2dc5ac1fb0f72efbe1.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b820144c2000","dlc":[]}